> You can use one of the following four methods to submit a face photo: FaceContrastPicture, FaceContrastPictureUrl, CertifyId, or OSS. Select one method.', example='0bfa7c493f850e5178b9f8613634c9xx'),
  sourceFaceContrastPicture?: string(name='SourceFaceContrastPicture', description='The Base64-encoded photo.

> You can use one of the following four methods to submit a face photo: FaceContrastPicture, FaceContrastPictureUrl, CertifyId, or OSS. Select one method.', example='/9j/4AAQSkZJRgABAQAASxxxxxxx'),
